rong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421196-untitled-vtm-battle-royal-video-game-announced?p=1421290#post1421290\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If it's a Battle Royal game, it'll probably consist of Anarchs vs. Camarilla in a ruined Steel Town with no plot.</div> </div> </div> </div>China forced PUGB, a plotless Battle Royal game, to censor the word &quot;Taiwan&quot; globally. Animal Crossing... which has the plot of working hard and being a good citizen, got banned because of pro-Hong Kong autonomy community content.<br /> <br /> Their censorship boards (yes plural, even if it's not has malicious as that sounds) have dinged games for female characters encouraging improper values by dressing too sexily, have very different standards around blood and gore (which isn't inherently a bad thing, but it gets a lot of games in trouble there), and they can interpret their mandate to protect &quot;Chinese values&quot; very broadly.<br /> <br /> If this game is going to be sold in China's very lucrative gaming market, not only is game content going to have to meet China's censorship policies, but so is player communications and player made content.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T09:34:32-08:00","id":1421302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421196-untitled-vtm-battle-royal-video-game-announced?p=1421257#post1421257\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Never heard of Sharkmob before,...</div> </div> </div> </div>This appears to be the company's first game that they have announced.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T09:38:07-08:00","id":1421303,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1421196-untitled-vtm-battle-royal-video-game-announced?p=1421294#post1421294\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> it's set in Prague</div> </div> </div> </div>This is an important fact. The fallout of Theo Bell killing Hardestadt could make this game fit in lore-wise if the setting is the Convention of Prague.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25049-zakrulz","name":"ZakRulz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25049_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T19:29:03-08:00","id":1421382,"title":"","content":"If climbing up walls from ground level to rooftops makes it from the announcement cinematic to the actual game, I could give this a try. I miss the 2016 &quot;Nosgoth&quot; game that never made it out of beta.<br /> <br /> Whether this project has more longevity that Nosgoth did is an open question. The market is absolutely saturated with this type of game. It'll be up to the implementation of the Kindred's supernatural powers to set it apart.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T19:32:49-08:00","id":1421383,"title":"","content":"I got a feeling this is going to be along the lines of that Shadowrun fps that came out ages ago, no real plot just multiplayer shoot em up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-01T20:10:25-08:00","id":1421387,"title":"","content":"Looks like its 